Module 12: Darwin and Evolution. The connected lab is Lab 12 Darwin Evolution.

3
00:00:10,588 --> 00:00:15,816
Here is the central idea: Darwin and Evolution explains natural selection from

4
00:00:15,816 --> 00:00:20,508
variation, heritability, fitness, and ancestry evidence. Let us begin.

5
00:00:21,258 --> 00:00:25,600
By the end of this module you should be able to: Explain natural selection using

6
00:00:25,600 --> 00:00:29,996
variation, heritability, and reproductive success; Define fitness in evolutionary

7
00:00:29,996 --> 00:00:34,121
terms; Distinguish individual change from population evolution; Use multiple

8
00:00:34,121 --> 00:00:38,463
